'''Pointy Bits''' (ツンツンツン, ''Tsun Tsun Tsun'', '''Poke Poke Poke''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': "Strengthen" Effect UP (Sm): Strengthen Up buff increases by 20%.

'''Pre 4.7''': "Strengthen" Effect UP (M): Strengthen Up buff increases by 30%.

